Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.58,Leg,,0,0,0,,Na aula de hoje,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:01.22,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai aprender
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:02.00,Leg,,0,0,0,,a fazer o treino HIIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.52,Leg,,0,0,0,,Como é que você faz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,o treino HIIT?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:03.74,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aqui na bicicleta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:04.37,Leg,,0,0,0,,por exemplo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:04.96,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai colocar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.09,Leg,,0,0,0,,uma carga moderada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:06.95,Leg,,0,0,0,,pra pesada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:10.18,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai pedalar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:10.82,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:11.63,Leg,,0,0,0,,que você conseguir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:12.10,Leg,,0,0,0,,por, vamos supor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:13.40,Leg,,0,0,0,,15 segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:14.80,Leg,,0,0,0,,Sem parar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.70,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você consegue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.98,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:21.40,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai diminuir o ritmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.27,Leg,,0,0,0,,Vai ficar 15 segundos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:23.70,Leg,,0,0,0,,pedalando no ritmo lento.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.95,0:00:28.07,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:28.98,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai pedalar novamente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:30.40,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você consegue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:38.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:39.80,Leg,,0,0,0,,novamente, pedala devagar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:42.10,Leg,,0,0,0,,Respira, dá uma respirada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.06,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 15 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:45.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,acelera de novo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:47.70,Leg,,0,0,0,,E assim por diante.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:48.70,Leg,,0,0,0,,Como é que eu vou saber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:49.82,Leg,,0,0,0,,quanto tempo eu faço isso,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:50.43,Leg,,0,0,0,,quantas vezes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:51.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,Agora eu vou te explicar melhor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:52.31,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai precisar instalar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.31,0:00:53.01,Leg,,0,0,0,,esse aplicativo aqui,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:53.82,Leg,,0,0,0,,vem cá que eu vou te mostrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.41,Leg,,0,0,0,,O nome dele é Timer Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:56.23,Leg,,0,0,0,,é um timer aqui, ó,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.23,0:00:57.52,Leg,,0,0,0,,00:30, verdinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:00:58.76,Leg,,0,0,0,,Se você não encontrar ele,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:00:59.69,Leg,,0,0,0,,você pode mandar mensagem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:00.21,Leg,,0,0,0,,no nosso suporte,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.21,0:01:00.95,Leg,,0,0,0,,que a gente envia o link.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:01.82,Leg,,0,0,0,,Após instalado,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:02.78,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai abrir ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:03.67,Leg,,0,0,0,,Agora eu vou te mostrar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:04.59,Leg,,0,0,0,,como que você configura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:06.13,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aqui em cima tem um reloginho.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.13,0:01:07.13,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai clicar nele
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:07.95,Leg,,0,0,0,,e vai configurar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:08.88,Leg,,0,0,0,,conforme está aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.93,0:01:09.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,Preparar:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.09,Leg,,0,0,0,,vai ser o tempo pra você começar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:12.71,Leg,,0,0,0,,Exercício e descanso:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:13.69,Leg,,0,0,0,,vai ser o tempo do HIIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:14.43,Leg,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te mandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:16.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,pra você na sua ficha personalizada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:17.19,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aqui, por exemplo,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:18.65,Leg,,0,0,0,,eu botei 15 segundos de tiro
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:20.25,Leg,,0,0,0,,e 15 segundos de descanso,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.25,0:01:21.60,Leg,,0,0,0,,num total de 10 rodadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:24.30,Leg,,0,0,0,,Como isso funciona na prática?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:25.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,Eu vou botar aqui pra rodar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:26.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,pra você entender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.05,Leg,,0,0,0,,5 segundos pra você ter atenção.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:31.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,Começou!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:33.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,Ficou no verdinho,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:34.55,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai pedalar daquele jeito,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:35.38,Leg,,0,0,0,,acelerado,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:36.70,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você conseguir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:47.60,Leg,,0,0,0,,No descansar,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:48.86,Leg,,0,0,0,,você não vai descansar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:50.11,Leg,,0,0,0,,Você vai pedalar devagar,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:51.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,como foi mostrado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:02.87,Leg,,0,0,0,,Acabou de descansar,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:03.66,Leg,,0,0,0,,você volta a pedalar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:04.80,Leg,,0,0,0,,o mais rápido que você conseguir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.50,Leg,,0,0,0,,E assim por diante.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:07.33,Leg,,0,0,0,,Repara aqui em cima
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:08.45,Leg,,0,0,0,,que o treino tem somente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.45,0:02:09.05,Leg,,0,0,0,,4 minutos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:10.03,Leg,,0,0,0,,Mas vai ser os 4 minutos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:11.30,Leg,,0,0,0,,mais intensos da sua vida.
